  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Shin Geurim, an extramarital child of a huge corporation and a stage director by profession, wakes up one day inside a web novel. She has possessed the body of Luiza Messena, a villainess who obsessively collects beautiful things and is so consumed by beauty that she ends up executed. Even though she’s now in the body of a villainess whose ending is death, there’s only one thing she can truly do inside that body: \n\n“I’ll put on a play.” \n\nIn her world, there’s nothing but directing, actors, the stage, and the audience. There’s the cheeky slave actor who says, \n\n“Didn’t you buy me because you wanted to have me? You don’t need excuses like ‘actress’ or ‘actor’—I already belong to you. So you can kiss me however you want.” \n\nAnd the fiancé who tells her, “You really are someone who can’t love anything except the stage. In that case, use me as you please.” …but Geurim sets them both aside.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69054232), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%95%85%EB%85%80%EB%8A%94-%EB%A1%9C%ED%8C%90%EC%9D%84-%EC%97%B0%EC%B6%9C%ED%95%9C%EB%8B%A4/4859)",
